abstract: >-
  This is a substantially revised reformulation of the Omnidimensional
  Quantum-Cosmological Theory (OQCT). Built on a 10-dimensional
  non-commutative operator manifold M^10_QC = R^{1,3} × C^6 × H_Q with
  an observer-coupling sector C^6 carrying SU(3) × U(1) gauge structure,
  the theory recasts every previous assertion under explicit hypotheses
  with rigorous proofs. New contributions include: a Lorentz-covariant
  constant-θ formulation of the non-commutative algebra with proven
  Jacobi identity and associative Moyal product; rigorous proofs of
  non-negativity, joint concavity, and partial-trace monotonicity for
  the observer-coupling entropy functional; derivation of the extended
  Born rule from a POVM-Gleason theorem; two-loop beta function
  computation with UV-attractive fixed point; derivation of the
  black-hole logarithmic correction from the conformal anomaly; and a
  rigorous proof that the temporal triality operator is essentially
  self-adjoint with discrete Planck-unit spectrum. Five worked examples
  and a transparent Status of the Theory table distinguish proven
  theorems, falsifiable conjectures, and phenomenological fits.
keywords:
  - non-commutative geometry
  - Moyal deformation
  - quantum gravity
  - operator manifold
  - observer-coupling sector
  - quantum entropy
  - POVM-Gleason theorem
  - renormalization group
  - asymptotic safety
  - black-hole entropy
  - cosmological perturbations
  - temporal triality
